  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b58774e01647a1dce8585af0b0e3da55f676e12ce10b27c06a6c9935db9f0739.png] \n\nGiven equation 8 * 4 * 7 * 8 * 2 * 35\n\nOption 1 : Using the combination ×, -, ÷, +, =\n\n8 × 4 – 7 ÷ 8 + 2 = 35\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n8 × 4 – 0.875 + 2 = 35\n\n32 – 0.875 + 2 = 35\n\n34 – 0.875 = 35\n\n33.125 = 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n**Option 2 : Using combination ****×, +, -, ÷, =**\n\n**8 × 4 + 7 - 8 ÷ 2 = 35**\n\n**8 × 4 + 7 - 4 = 35**\n\n**32 + 7 - 4 = 35**\n\n**39 – 4 = 35**\n\n**35 = 35 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3 : Using the combination +, -, ×, ÷, =\n\n8 + 4 – 7 × 8 ÷ 2 = 35\n\n8 + 4 – 7 × 4 = 35\n\n8 + 4 – 28 = 35\n\n12 – 28 = 35\n\n-16 = 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4 : Using the combination -, ×, +, ÷, =\n\n8 - 4 × 7 + 8 ÷ 2 = 35\n\n8 - 4 × 7 + 4 = 35\n\n8 - 28 + 4 = 35\n\n12 - 28 = 35\n\n-16 = 35 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, the answer is **“****×, +, -, ÷, =****”**.",
